---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="What we do">
  <div class="w-full px-10 py-3">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Building the future of health with technology and data</h1>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl">We build what clinicians need.</h2>

    <p>
    Our Incubator program connects clinicians and developers to build digital tools that they need.
    </p>
    <p>
      We work iteratively and collaboratively to engineer usable, reliable systems you'll want to use every day.
    </p>
    <p>
      Backed by the non-profit <a href="https://www.rcpch.ac.uk/">RCPCH</a>, we build what helps our users, not what the
      market demands.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">We are healthcare tech experts</h2>

    <p>
      We can help at all stages of a project, from requirements gathering through development to production
    </p>

    <p>
      Many of our development team are also practicing clinicans who understand healthcare inside out.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our work is interoperable, API driven and secure.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">We improve the health of children, young people and their families - worldwide.</h2>
    
    <p>
      We meet our users where they are. Our technical expertise spans web apps, mobile and backend integrations.
    </p>

    <p>
      We make accessible, lightweight tools that work on any device and in low bandwidth environments.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">We develop in the open.</h2>

    <p>
      We publish our source code on GitHub wherever possible and develop in the open.
    </p>
    <p>
      Transparency improves security and allows our users to contribute improvements.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>